# data/ IS committed. Streamlit Community Cloud serves only what is in the
# repo, so the app's inputs have to be tracked -- that is why the repo is
# private with a viewer allowlist. Total is ~10 MB (grid_annual.parquet is
# 7.4 MB), comfortably under GitHub's 50 MB per-file warning.
